{"id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-homomorphism.md","title":"Homomorphism","display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-homomorphism","aliases":["93-df-homomorphism"],"display":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-homomorphism — Homomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\)</span> are algebra candidates and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> is a map candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\">\\(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\)</span> is the explicitly defined tuple obtained by applying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> coordinatewise.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span> is the type-recovering homomorphism predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,h(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,h(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i&lt;n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\nh:A\\to B\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\n\\to\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\in B^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\nh:A\\to B\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\n\\to\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\in B^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land h:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(h(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar a))\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land h:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(h(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar a))\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quantified pair <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> witnesses one common complete similarity type and removes the former free carrier and signature variables. Coordinatewise tuple action is an actual set-valued constructor. For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha(f)=0\">\\(\\alpha(f)=0\\)</span>, the displayed equation reduces to preservation of the corresponding constant.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-algebra]] and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-algebra]] and [[93-df-similarity-type]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,h(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i<n\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\nh:A\\to B\\land n\\in\\omega\\land\\bar a\\in A^n\n\\to\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,n,\\bar a)\\in B^n","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathfrak B)\\\\\n&\\land h:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\in S\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^{\\alpha(f)}\\;\\Bigl(h(f^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=f^{\\mathfrak B}(\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}(h,\\alpha(f),\\bar a))\\Bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha(f)=0","display":false}],"bytes":1847,"backlinks":[{"id":"97b46a497e251f9f","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged term constructor, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}$ is defined here by recursion on the construction stage of [[93-df-term]]."},{"id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the type-recovering homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]] and $\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}$ is defined here."},{"id":"98ea8403ba8386af","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$, $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$, and $\\mathrm{SimilarityType}$ are sourced from [[93-df-algebra]], [[93-df-homomorphism]], and [[93-df-similarity-type]]."},{"id":"56c1f813209c75e1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"64f6348f5d9119d6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"18afee354a7c01b0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"87bee95cbaea0934","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fe06c83d404633c2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the type-recovering homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"03a4b56655d6ad49","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2f5dec406c92aa2e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5b18fd1da461692","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ is the homomorphism predicate of [[93-df-homomorphism]], and $\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}$ is defined here."},{"id":"aa0a957ca4da4328","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8e602c19b2984096","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit coordinatewise tuple-map of [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"8181bcdfbad8d73a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LogicAlg}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}$ are from [[93-df-logic-algebra]] and [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"4f176786881b1435","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1621c792830f597","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3d2061022c1cccc3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8fa0cc7c74aae956","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle$ is a similarity type, $X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, and $v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|$; $\\operatorname{App}_{93}$ is the tagged constructor of [[93-df-term]], and $\\operatorname{MapTuple}_{93}$ is the explicit tuple map of [[93-df-homomorphism]]."},{"id":"ebabc4cd0b0d94d0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fcafc6e9cc20d2e8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34a91ec31209cb96","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","ee84ed8b0fae5bc3"]}